; A one-letter currency is read when a space, a tab or the end of the line follows it.
2026-01-01 open Assets:A
2026-01-01 open Assets:B
2026-01-01 open Assets:Foo-X
2026-01-01 open Assets:C X
2026-01-01 commodity X

* X} in a margin comment, and in the next line, a string that spans lines:
2026-01-02 * "a string with X} in it
and a second line with X} too" #X ^X
  Assets:A  1 X
  Assets:B  -1 X ; X} in a comment
2026-01-03 P "flags are not currencies"
  P Assets:A  1 X1
  Assets:B  -1 X1
2026-01-04 *
  Assets:A  1 XB
  Assets:B  -1 XB
2026-01-05 *
  Assets:A  1 X.B
  Assets:B  -1 X.B
2026-01-06 *
  Assets:A	1 X'B {2 X-B}
  Assets:B	-2 X-B
